{"tool":"calculate","arguments":{"expression":"a - b","variables":{"a":{"value":214.4,"source":"source:t8c1n0","unit":"$ millions"},"b":{"value":70.5,"source":"source:t1c2n0","unit":"$ millions"}},"sources":{"a":"source:t8c1n0","b":"source:t1c2n0"}},"message":"The increase over the 2007–2008 period is the ending unrecognized tax benefit balance at December 27, 2008 minus the beginning balance at the start of 2007. Using the reconciliation table: ending 2008 = $214.4 million; beginning 2007 = $70.5 million."}